      "rejected": "I see the Force did not choose you for this after all.",
      "advice": "This world is unfamiliar to me, and I sense a great disturbance in it. My comrade probably feels the same.",
      "inquire": "Have you found my fellow Jedi yet?",
      "success": "Good. Our odds just got a lot better.",
      "success_lie": "I sense... deception.",
      "failure": "Giving up already?"
